        {
          "_key": "786d97889a7c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "undergraduate education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "eb0682809424",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in India’s leading universities and institutes."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a64a46fa2ff2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "216a10d8f797",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Whether you’re dreaming of becoming an engineer, pharmacist, nurse, or agricultural scientist, the COMPEX Scheme could be your path to academic and professional success."
